{"step_index":9426,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-26T07:55:06Z","thinking":"The `client_email` points to a service account. The prior revocation of `personaldrive:` likely stems from Iraq Bhai's manual revocation of rclone's OAuth access within his Google account. This action resulted in the reported 401 Invalid Credentials error, particularly when `rclone` attempts to use `personaldrive:`, indicating an expired or revoked token.\n\n\nThe service account's \"storageQuotaExceeded\" error strongly suggests it cannot directly upload to standard Google Drive. Further research reveals this is expected behavior, as service accounts lack individual storage quota in personal Google Drive accounts. The options appear to be using a Google Workspace shared drive, implementing domain-wide delegation, or utilizing a user's OAuth token. The immediate next step is to examine methods for re-authenticating the personal drive via OAuth within the current environment.\n\n\nInvestigating the previous authentication method for `personaldrive:` is crucial. Searching the session transcript for configuration details or authorization commands is necessary. Determining if Iraq Bhai prefers a live sync system directs the focus to the appropriate Google Drive synchronization options.\n\nConsidering Iraq Bhai's preferences, two primary options exist: re-authenticating with user OAuth or leveraging a Google Workspace Shared Drive. The OAuth option requires a one-time authorization, potentially offering unlimited upload to a personal Google Drive, if that is the case. Utilizing a Shared Drive involves granting the service account access, which may avoid quota limitations.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"{\n  \"remote_name\": \"personaldrive\",\n  \"remote_base_dir\": \"Azure_VM_LiveSync\",\n  \"sync_interval_seconds\": 60,\n  \"safe_mode\": true,\n  \"sync_targets\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"AGY-MASTER\",\n      \"local_path\": \"/home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER\",\n      \"remote_subpath\": \"AGY-MASTER\",\n      \"enabled\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Frappe-erp-Alco\",\n      \"local_path\": \"/home/azureuser/Frappe-erp-Alco\",\n      \"remote_subpath\": \"Frappe-erp-Alco\",\n      \"enabled\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Rust-Tasks\",\n      \"local_path\": \"/home/azureuser/Rust_Task_With_Time_Keeping_And_Live_Note\",\n      \"remote_subpath\": \"Rust_Task_With_Time_Keeping_And_Live_Note\",\n      \"enabled\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Youtube-Exports\",\n      \"local_path\": \"/home/azureuser/.openclaw/workspace/IROSCRIPT-CEO/social-media/youtube/Youtube Automation/PromptDatabase/exports\",\n      \"remote_subpath\": \"Youtube_Exports\",\n      \"enabled\": true\n    }\n  ],\n  \"global_excludes\": [\n    \"node_modules/**\",\n    \".git/**\",\n    \"**/target/debug/**\",\n    \"**/target/release/incremental/**\",\n    \"**/__pycache__/**\",\n    \"*.pyc\",\n    \"*.tmp\",\n    \".system_generated/**\"\n  ]\n}\n","Description":"Google Drive live sync configuration mapping local directories to Google Drive remote paths","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/home/azureuser/gdrive_sync/sync_config.json","toolAction":"Creating sync configuration json","toolSummary":"Create sync_config.json"}}]}
