{"step_index":9430,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-26T07:55:22Z","thinking":"Management script creation is the next step. The script will handle starting and stopping the synchronization service, checking its status, triggering an immediate sync, and displaying logs. The script needs to integrate with the systemd service or background daemon, depending on the setup. The script must be robust enough to handle various operational scenarios.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# ==============================================================================\n# Google Drive Live Sync Manager\n# Author: Antigravity AI (Pair Programming with Iraq Bhai)\n# ==============================================================================\nset -euo pipefail\n\nBASE_DIR=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"${BASH_SOURCE[0]}\")\" && pwd)\"\nSERVICE_NAME=\"gdrive-live-sync.service\"\nLOG_FILE=\"$BASE_DIR/live_sync.log\"\nSTATE_FILE=\"$BASE_DIR/sync_state.json\"\n\ncase \"${1:-status}\" in\n    start)\n        echo \"[+] Starting Google Drive Live Sync service...\"\n        systemctl --user start \"$SERVICE_NAME\"\n        systemctl --user status \"$SERVICE_NAME\" --no-pager\n        ;;\n    stop)\n        echo \"[-] Stopping Google Drive Live Sync service...\"\n        systemctl --user stop \"$SERVICE_NAME\"\n        echo \"[-] Service stopped.\"\n        ;;\n    restart)\n        echo \"[*] Restarting Google Drive Live Sync service...\"\n        systemctl --user restart \"$SERVICE_NAME\"\n        systemctl --user status \"$SERVICE_NAME\" --no-pager\n        ;;\n    status)\n        echo \"==============================================================================\"\n        echo \"GOOGLE DRIVE LIVE SYNC STATUS\"\n        echo \"==============================================================================\"\n        systemctl --user status \"$SERVICE_NAME\" --no-pager || true\n        echo \"------------------------------------------------------------------------------\"\n        if [[ -f \"$STATE_FILE\" ]]; then\n            echo \"[*] Last Sync State:\"\n            cat \"$STATE_FILE\"\n            echo \"\"\n        fi\n        echo \"------------------------------------------------------------------------------\"\n        echo \"[*] Last 10 Log Entries:\"\n        if [[ -f \"$LOG_FILE\" ]]; then\n            tail -n 10 \"$LOG_FILE\"\n        else\n            echo \"No log entries found.\"\n        fi\n        echo \"==============================================================================\"\n        ;;\n    sync-now)\n        echo \"[*] Triggering immediate single-pass sync...\"\n        /usr/bin/python3 \"$BASE_DIR/gdrive_live_sync.py\" --once\n        ;;\n    logs)\n        tail -f \"$LOG_FILE\"\n        ;;\n    *)\n        echo \"Usage: $0 {start|stop|restart|status|sync-now|logs}\"\n        exit 1\n        ;;\nesac\n","Description":"Management CLI script for Google Drive live sync system","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/home/azureuser/gdrive_sync/manage_sync.sh","toolAction":"Creating management CLI script","toolSummary":"Create manage_sync.sh"}}]}
