{"step_index":9469,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-26T08:33:45Z","thinking":"Initiating the listener to capture the authorization URL. The generated link needs to be saved for user interaction. Examining the listener script reveals its function: launching a process and extracting the required address from its output.\n\n\nA Google Accounts URL is generated and saved locally for user interaction, alongside a simple HTML redirect page. This HTML approach simplifies the authorization process: the user can open the redirect on their phone, authenticate, and copy the redirect URL back to the VM. The script then waits for this callback URL to be written to a file, subsequently obtaining the necessary authorization token. The token updates the configuration and starts the syncing service.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\nGoogle Drive OAuth Helper for Remote Headless VM\nAuthor: Antigravity AI\n\"\"\"\n\nimport subprocess\nimport time\nimport re\nimport urllib.request\nimport urllib.error\nimport os\nimport sys\n\nBASE_DIR = \"/home/azureuser/gdrive_sync\"\nEXPORTS_DIR = \"/home/azureuser/.openclaw/workspace/IROSCRIPT-CEO/social-media/youtube/Youtube Automation/PromptDatabase/exports\"\nAUTH_URL_FILE = os.path.join(BASE_DIR, \"auth_url.txt\")\nHTML_FILE = os.path.join(EXPORTS_DIR, \"gdrive_login.html\")\nCALLBACK_FILE = os.path.join(BASE_DIR, \"callback_url.txt\")\n\ndef start_oauth():\n    print(\"[*] Starting rclone authorize drive...\")\n    p = subprocess.Popen(\n        [\"/usr/bin/rclone\", \"authorize\", \"drive\"],\n        stdout=subprocess.PIPE,\n        stderr=subprocess.PIPE,\n        text=True\n    )\n\n    # Read stderr for the local auth URL\n    local_url = None\n    for _ in range(50):\n        line = p.stderr.readline()\n        if not line:\n            time.sleep(0.1)\n            continue\n        m = re.search(r'(http://127\\.0\\.0\\.1:53682/auth\\?state=[^\\s]+)', line)\n        if m:\n            local_url = m.group(1)\n            break\n\n    if not local_url:\n        print(\"[!] Failed to get local auth URL from rclone.\")\n        p.terminate()\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    print(f\"[*] Local auth URL: {local_url}\")\n\n    # Resolve the redirect to Google\n    class NoRedirect(urllib.request.HTTPRedirectHandler):\n        def http_error_302(self, req, fp, code, msg, headers):\n            return headers\n\n    opener = urllib.request.build_opener(NoRedirect)\n    headers = opener.open(local_url)\n    google_url = headers.get(\"Location\")\n\n    if not google_url:\n        print(\"[!] Failed to resolve Google OAuth Location header.\")\n        p.terminate()\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    print(f\"[+] Direct Google OAuth URL obtained!\")\n    with open(AUTH_URL_FILE, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(google_url.strip())\n\n    # Create one-click HTML redirect\n    html_content = f\"\"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <title>Google Drive 1-Click Login</title>\n    <meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" content=\"1;url={google_url}\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"font-family:sans-serif; text-align:center; padding: 40px;\">\n    <h2>Google Drive Authentication</h2>\n    <p>Redirecting to Google Sign-in...</p>\n    <p><a href=\"{google_url}\" style=\"display:inline-block; padding:12px 24px; background:#4285F4; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:5px; font-weight:bold;\">Click here if not redirected automatically</a></p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top:30px; font-size:14px; color:#666;\">After logging in, your browser will redirect to <b>127.0.0.1:53682</b> with a code in the address bar.<br>Copy that full address bar URL and paste it back into the chat!</p>\n</body>\n</html>\n\"\"\"\n    with open(HTML_FILE, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(html_content)\n\n    print(f\"[+] One-click login page written to {HTML_FILE}\")\n\n    # Remove any old callback file\n    if os.path.exists(CALLBACK_FILE):\n        os.remove(CALLBACK_FILE)\n\n    print(\"[*] Waiting for callback URL in callback_url.txt ...\")\n    token_json = None\n\n    while p.poll() is None:\n        if os.path.exists(CALLBACK_FILE):\n            with open(CALLBACK_FILE, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n                cb_url = f.read().strip()\n            if cb_url:\n                print(f\"[*] Processing callback URL: {cb_url[:50]}...\")\n                try:\n                    # Hit the local listener with the callback parameters\n                    # Replace whatever host with 127.0.0.1:53682\n                    clean_cb = re.sub(r'https?://[^/]+', 'http://127.0.0.1:53682', cb_url)\n                    print(f\"[*] Forwarding to local rclone: {clean_cb[:60]}...\")\n                    urllib.request.urlopen(clean_cb, timeout=5)\n                except Exception as e:\n                    print(f\"[*] Forward request result: {e}\")\n                os.remove(CALLBACK_FILE)\n                break\n        time.sleep(1)\n\n    stdout, stderr = p.communicate(timeout=15)\n    print(\"[*] rclone stdout:\", stdout[:200])\n\n    m = re.search(r'(\\{\"access_token\":.*?\\})', stdout, re.DOTALL)\n    if m:\n        token_str = m.group(1).replace(\"\\n\", \"\").replace(\"\\r\", \"\")\n        print(\"[+] SUCCESS! New token extracted.\")\n        \n        # Update rclone.conf\n        conf_path = \"/home/azureuser/.config/rclone/rclone.conf\"\n        with open(conf_path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            conf = f.read()\n\n        # Update [personaldrive] section\n        new_conf = re.sub(r'(\\[personaldrive\\].*?token\\s*=\\s*).*?(\\n\\w|\\n\\Z)', r'\\g<1>' + token_str + r'\\2', conf, flags=re.DOTALL)\n        with open(conf_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            f.write(new_conf)\n\n        print(\"[+] rclone.conf successfully updated with new token!\")\n        return True\n    else:\n        print(\"[!] No token found in rclone output.\")\n        return False\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    start_oauth()\n","Description":"OAuth helper to manage background rclone authorization with 1-click web redirect and callback handling","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/home/azureuser/gdrive_sync/oauth_helper.py","toolAction":"Creating OAuth helper script","toolSummary":"Create oauth_helper.py"}}]}
